# `sum` of reals is `real`, of integers `long`, of timespans `timespan`; nulls are ignored,
# and a sum of no non-null values is null (LANGUAGE.md §7).
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| summarize r = sum(amount), l = sum(tolong(amount)), t = sum(30m), none = sumif(amount, isnull(amount))
---- expected
r      | l    | t          | none
real   | long | timespan   | real
-------+------+------------+-----
4221.5 | 4210 | 1.01:00:00 | null
